  "summary": "Logging Redactor: PII data in str/repr of non primitive objects was not being redacted",
  "details": "Impact\nPII data in str/repr of non primitive objects was not being redacted, leading to leakage of PII in logs that should have been redacted for custom `__str__` and `__repr__` functions\n\nPatches\nThe problem has been patched in version 0.0.7.\n\nWorkarounds\nNone without patching.",
